    "passiveCard": "<div id=\"card-sec-1\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-1\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\" class=\"\">Basic effect(s)</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-1\"><li>Ki +5, ATK &amp; DEF 400%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Launches an additional Super Attack</li><li>Damage reduction rate 50%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li class=\"\">Randomly changes Ki Spheres of a certain Type to Rainbow Ki Spheres</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-2\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-2\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\" class=\"\">For every attacked received or evaded</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-2\"><li class=\"\"><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Ki +1 (up to +8)</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">ATK 100%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> (up to 600%)</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Chance of evading enemy's attack 5% (up to 30%)</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming a Super Attack (up to 3 times)</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-3\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-3\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">For every Rainbow Ki Sphere obtained</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-3\"><li>Chance of evading enemy's attack 10%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> within the turn</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-4\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-4\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">For every Super Attack the enemy launches at the character</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-4\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">All Allies ATK &amp; DEF 40%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-5\" class=\"\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-5\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\" class=\"\">When receiving a Super Attack</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-5\"><li>Great chance of nullifying it and countering with with tremendous power</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Nullifies it and counters with ferocious power when facing only 1 enemy and that enemy's HP is 50% or less</li></ul></div>",
